        "original_id": "79cd0efa-16c3-52b2-a555-033083ce0ae6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: KWPW\n- People: Bill McCutcheon, James William McCutcheon\n- Products: \"Power 108\"\n- Topics: contemporary hit radio\n\nFacts:\n- James William McCutcheon was born on May 23, 1924, and died on January 9, 2002.\n- James William McCutcheon was an American character actor known for roles in film, television, and theatre, and several of those roles won Emmy and Tony awards.\n- KWPW is a radio station broadcasting a contemporary hit radio format.\n- KWPW broadcasts on 107.9 FM and uses the brand name \"Power 108.\"\n- KWPW is currently owned by Bill McCutcheon.",
